    {
      "id": "s1",
      "title": "Chat: an advisor on the phone",
      "text": "As of October 2026, the same Claude can work in three places, and each reaches different things. In **chat**, like an advisor on the phone, Claude works with what you upload, in an isolated sandbox separate from your computer. **Connectors** link it to outside apps and services.",
      "show": [
        "chat"
      ],
      "emphasize": [
        "chat"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "title": "Cowork: a borrowed office",
      "text": "**Cowork** is built on the same agentic engine as Claude Code (it works through a task step by step on its own), with no terminal. It runs in the cloud by default and reads and writes only folders you've connected. Products change fast: Anthropic is merging chat and Cowork for some plans.",
      "add": [
        "cowork",
        "files"
      ],
      "emphasize": [
        "cowork"
      ],
      "dim": [
        "chat"
      ],
