    {
      "id": "s3",
      "title": "Claude Code: at your own desk",
      "text": "**Claude Code** runs in your **terminal**, the app where you type commands and read the replies. It works on your own Mac with your keys: the folder you start it in and the ones inside, files elsewhere with your permission, any command you could run. (It can run in the cloud too; this series is about your Mac.)",
      "add": [
