    {
      "id": "s4",
      "title": "It works by running commands",
      "text": "Claude Code works through text: with its **Bash tool** it runs commands in a shell it starts on your Mac, not in your Terminal window, and reads the replies, like `ls` to look around or `grep` to search inside files. About your files, it knows only what it has read.",
      "add": [
        "term"
