      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "title": "You review, you steer",
      "text": "As of October 2026, Claude Code's default mode runs most commands without asking, with background safety checks, and the review is still yours. Knowing what a command does lets you check its work and steer it toward the efficient way.",
      "add": [
        "review"
